# City life on screen and in the ears (src/life/ through the world renderer): the Forum at 07:00
# on an April morning is full of people the crowd hears at its loudest (stepped back under Rome's
# music, which leads: audio_mix_world); with nobody about the crowd falls silent; at night the
# climate's night bed plays; in rain the rain family does (under the music), and the crowd
# hushes. Every live person stands on walkable ground at its level.
set season spring
set day 9
set time 0.0417
set world forum 1
wait 240
expect city ground ok
expect city slots ok
expect city moving
expect city drawn 100 900
expect city people 60 900
expect city sound amb/world/crowd_latin_3.ogg 20 60
expect city sound amb/world/crowd_latin_1.ogg 0 0
shot shots/city_forum_morning.png
set world forum 2
wait 60
expect city drawn 20 400
shot shots/city_forum_2x.png
set city off
waitfor 900 city drawn 0 0
wait 10
expect city drawn 0 0
expect city people 0 0
expect city sound amb/world/crowd_latin_3.ogg 0 0
set city camera
set time 0.75
wait 240
expect city sound amb/world/night_scrub.ogg 40 100
shot shots/city_forum_night.png
set time 0.1
set rain on
wait 240
expect city sound amb/world/rain_3.ogg 50 100
shot shots/city_forum_rain.png
quit
